# Print each user-bus signal that busctl reports, one JSON line per message.
# busctl runs until the program is stopped. Change the match rule in this file to
# watch a different signal. Each record is the handler's pipeline input, so the
# handler forwards it unchanged to stdout.
# Run with: execute examples/desktop/dbus-monitor.program
listen to dbus.monitor_user with match "type='signal'"
whenever a line arrives as message
  then "cat"
